{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isEmoji","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This property is true for scalars that are rendered as emoji by default"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and also for scalars that have a non-default emoji rendering when followed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"by U+FE0F VARIATION SELECTOR-16. This includes some scalars that are not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"typically considered to be emoji:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let scalars: [Unicode.Scalar] = [\"😎\", \"$\", \"0\"]","for s in scalars {","    print(s, \"-->\", s.properties.isEmoji)","}","\/\/ 😎 --> true","\/\/ $ --> false","\/\/ 0 --> true"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The final result is true because the ASCII digits have non-default emoji"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presentations; some platforms render these with an alternate appearance."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Because of this behavior, testing "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isEmoji"},{"type":"text","text":" alone on a single scalar is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"insufficient to determine if a unit of text is rendered as an emoji; a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"correct test requires inspecting multiple scalars in a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Character"},{"type":"text","text":". In"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"addition to checking whether the base scalar has "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isEmoji == true"},{"type":"text","text":", you"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"must also check its default presentation (see "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isEmojiPresentation"},{"type":"text","text":") and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"determine whether it is followed by a variation selector that would modify"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the presentation."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This property corresponds to the “Emoji” property in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"http:\/\/www.unicode.org\/versions\/latest\/","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swift\/unicode\/scalar\/properties-swift.struct\/isemoji"]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A Boolean value indicating whether the scalar has an emoji"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presentation, whether or not it is the default."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Unicode\/Scalar\/Properties-swift.struct\/isEmoji","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"title":"isEmoji","extendedModule":"Swift","roleHeading":"Instance Property","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isEmoji","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"externalID":"s:s7UnicodeO6ScalarV10PropertiesV7isEmojiSbvp","modules":[{"name":"Swift"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"property","platforms":[{"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"8.0"},{"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailabl